{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 326 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "8438517227ce7b83567fd6cf94d69ba8035608c630da02c6a6a0fdefcef7eba7" :edb/db-before-t 325 :edb/db-after-t 326 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533638 50 #inst "2026-10-04T05:17:11.326Z" 13194139533638 true] [17592186059788 1020 #edb/ref 17592186243340 13194139533638 true] [17592186059789 1020 #edb/ref 17592186243354 13194139533638 true] [17592186059790 1020 #edb/ref 17592186243347 13194139533638 true] [17592186059889 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533638 true] [17592186059889 1145 "The function $f(x)$ is the sum of three power functions. So, we apply the sum rule, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}-x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{-2})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =3{x}^{(3-1)}+(-2){x}^{(-2-1)}-1 \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}-2{x}^{-3}-1 \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}-\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533638 true] [17592186060095 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533638 true] [17592186060095 1145 "Here, we apply the addition, constant multiple, and power rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}-3{x}^{3/4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{-2})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{3/4}) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{-2})-3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3/4}) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-2){x}^{(-2-1)}-3\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}{x}^{(3/4-1)} \\\\  & =-4{x}^{-3}-\\frac{9}{4}{x}^{-1/4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}-\\frac{9}{4\\sqrt[4]{x}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243340 1017 #edb/ref 17592186243341 13194139533638 true] [17592186243340 1089 "q-102192" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243340 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533638 true] [17592186243340 1100 "If $y=\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}},$ find $\\frac{dy}{dx}.$" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243340 1113 #uuid "64cbbece-20d6-57d9-997e-c59586265d30" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243340 1138 false 13194139533638 true] [17592186243340 1145 "We first rewrite the function as\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}}=\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{-3/2}.\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the constant multiple and power rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{-3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{-3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{2}){x}^{(-\\frac{3}{2}-1)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-5/2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243342 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243343 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243344 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243345 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243346 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1041 "selection" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243346 13194139533638 true] [17592186243341 1110 #uuid "a64c0361-ce30-53f6-bc3e-3a68cc4b6bd9" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243342 1034 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}}" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243342 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533638 true] [17592186243342 1111 #uuid "99d16958-a5a3-503c-81cb-1965f5293d5d" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243343 1034 "\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533638 true] [17592186243343 1111 #uuid "512f6bb7-ee78-5501-a269-b4dbd9f897e4" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243344 1034 "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243344 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533638 true] [17592186243344 1111 #uuid "99681777-7362-5d34-9fc8-5dd187b7dcb6" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243345 1034 "-\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{x}}" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243345 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533638 true] [17592186243345 1111 #uuid "bc0e86e3-8b7a-5e60-8e33-e1742b0ce5a2" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243346 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243346 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533638 true] [17592186243346 1111 #uuid "83ebd53f-0d0c-5b21-aa44-bf773a901b8e" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243347 1017 #edb/ref 17592186243348 13194139533638 true] [17592186243347 1089 "q-1845" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243347 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533638 true] [17592186243347 1100 "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}-5x.$" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243347 1113 #uuid "1c2ccf62-2b83-5d0b-8d8f-47d193d15c4a" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243347 1138 false 13194139533638 true] [17592186243347 1145 "Here, we convert the radical into a rational exponent, and we apply the addition, constant multiple, and power rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}-5x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2/3})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2/3})-5\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}{x}^{(\\frac{2}{3}-1)}-5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}{x}^{-1/3}-5 \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3\\sqrt[3]{x}}-5\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243349 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243350 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243351 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243352 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243353 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1041 "selection" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243351 13194139533638 true] [17592186243348 1110 #uuid "4cc0aa9b-352a-562f-ba6a-92d96a09c36e" 13194139533638 true] [17592186243349 1034 "\\fr